            "landing": "context_events",
            "_api_notes": "GET /admin/api/{version}/products.json?published_at_min=&published_at_max=&limit=250 (Link rel=next cursor pagination). published_at = event_date (YYYY-MM-DD); title = label. A null published_at (unpublished product) emits no event. Reuses the existing shopify OAuth token/scope. Persisted to context_events (no fact_daily_kpi). AI-53: endpoint/field names declared from the Admin REST docs, to confirm on the live pass (no test account 2026-07-21)."
        }
